** a steel cantilever (B2D2, 10 x 10 rectangle, 5 Gauss points) embedded with its root (2 elements, 50 mm) in a
** practically rigid block (CPE4, E = 2.1e9); perfect bond by the embedded region constraint with the beam rotations
** tied to the rotation of the host material line along the axis (rotations=axis); the 200 mm free part deflects as
** a cantilever clamped at the block face: tip deflection P L^3 / (3 E I) = 0.0152381
*material, name=linearelastic, id=block, provider=marmot
2.1e9, 0.2

*material, name=linearelastic, id=steel, provider=marmot
210000.0, 0.3

